                                            <span style="font-size:1.3rem;" class="me-2">🌟</span>
                                            <div class="flex-grow-1">
                                                <div class="fw-bold small">Combo VIP</div>
                                                <div class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.7rem;">Nước + bánh + khăn + hoa xe + sạc dự phòng</div>
